  "id": "spiritual_crystal",
  "item": "omnira:spiritual_crystal",
  "title": "Spiritual Crystal",
  "text": [
    "Spiritual crystals are a fundamental condensed magical material, used to build further workstations.",
    "With a Primordial Spell Core as catalyst, each reaction in a cauldron or pool produces one Spiritual Crystal without item or fluid ingredients.",
    "They also serve as the substrate for low-tier spell crystals. Place one in the crystal processing table alongside ink and the microcores.",
    "Each reaction converts one Spiritual Crystal into one Infused Spiritual Crystal over an Infused Crystal Block, or into one Resonance Crystal over a Resonance Core. Neither needs fluid."
  ],
